              "id": "1774304578302_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your entire knowledge is limited to the following references.\nDo not use any other information to perform the task.\n  \n## references\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.context}}\n \n## problem\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.question}}\n  \nGiven the problem and references above perform the following steps:\n1. Extract a summary for the problem only from references.\n2. Identify the solution for the problem only from the extracted summary. Use a professional tone. Format the solution using paragraphs. Use at least {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.sizeLowerBound}} words. Use at most {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.sizeUpperBound}} words. If no solution is identified, respond with \"n/a\".\n \nReturn only the result from step 2 as plain text or \"n/a\" if no solution can be identified.\nReturn your response in the `{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.locale}}` locale.\nPlease include HTML formatting tags such as <p> <ol> <ul> <li> <strong> <br> in the solution instructions."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
